OL,3,ASeparatist party projected to win
OL,4,AQuebec election, adding new test to
OL,5,ACanada's unity
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanada's Parti Quebecois (PQ) is
OL,8,Fprojected to have won enough seats in
OL,9,FQuebec's provincial election to form a
OL,10,Fminority government, though the
OL,11,Fseparatists will need other parties'
OL,12,Fsupport to achieve their aims - such as
OL,13,Fa new public vote on independence.
OL,15,FIt marks the first time the PQ has been
OL,16,Fin power since 2014, with Paul
OL,17,FSt-Pierre Plamondon set to become the
OL,18,Fprovince's new leader.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
