OL,3,ASeparatist party projected to win
OL,4,AQuebec election, adding new test to
OL,5,ACanada's unity
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn his victory speech, St-Pierre
OL,8,FPlamondon again raised his independence
OL,9,Fplans but vowed to be "the premier of
OL,10,Feveryone in Quebec".
OL,12,FThe result could prove a fresh test for
OL,13,FPrime Minister Mark Carney, also
OL,14,Fsetting up confrontations with Quebec
OL,15,Fover issues like immigration and the
OL,16,Fmonarchy.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
